  "content": {
    "services": {
      "name": "Practice areas",
      "fields": [
        {
          "id": "summary",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "Summary (one line)"
        },
        {
          "id": "description",
          "type": "richtext",
          "label": "Description"
        },
        {
          "id": "team",
          "type": "entry",
          "label": "Lead",
          "content_type": "team"
        },
        {
          "id": "image",
          "type": "image",
          "label": "Image (3:4)"
        },
        {
          "id": "order",
          "type": "number",
          "label": "Position"
        }
      ],
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "svc_estate_planning",
          "handle": "estate-planning",
          "title": "Estate planning",
          "fields": {
            "summary": "Wills and trusts for single people and couples.",
            "description": "<p>A plan sets out who receives what you own, who looks after your children, and who decides for you if you cannot. Most plans are a will or a revocable living trust, with a durable power of attorney and a health care directive beside it.</p><p>We meet first by video for 30 minutes, then send an engagement letter that sets out the work before anything is drafted.</p>",
            "team": "team_ruth_thorne",
            "image": "as_estate_planning",
            "order": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "svc_trusts_and_powers_of_attorney",
          "handle": "trusts-and-powers-of-attorney",
          "title": "Trusts and powers of attorney",
          "fields": {
            "summary": "Powers of attorney, health care directives and trust amendments.",
            "description": "<p>A durable power of attorney and a health care directive name the people who act for you while you are alive. An amendment keeps an existing trust in step with a marriage, a birth or a move.</p>",
            "team": "team_ruth_thorne",
            "image": "as_trusts_and_powers_of_attorney",
            "order": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "svc_probate_and_trust_administration",
          "handle": "probate-and-trust-administration",
          "title": "Probate and trust administration",
          "fields": {
            "summary": "Small estate affidavits, probate and trust administration.",
            "description": "<p>When someone dies, their estate is gathered, their debts are paid and what remains is passed on. We handle Oregon probate, small estate affidavits and the administration of trusts, and we work with Washington counsel when property sits across the river.</p>",
            "team": "team_lena_marsh",
            "image": "as_probate_and_trust_administration",
            "order": 3
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "svc_business_formation",
          "handle": "business-formation",
          "title": "Business formation",
          "fields": {
            "summary": "LLC formation and operating agreements.",
            "description": "<p>We form limited liability companies and corporations, write the operating agreement or bylaws, and set out who owns what and who decides.</p>",
            "team": "team_chidi_abara",
            "image": "as_business_formation",
            "order": 4
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "svc_contracts_and_leases",
          "handle": "contracts-and-leases",
          "title": "Contracts and leases",
          "fields": {
            "summary": "Contract and lease review for small businesses.",
            "description": "<p>Before you sign a commercial lease, a supplier contract or a services agreement, we read it line by line and tell you what it commits you to.</p>",
            "team": "team_chidi_abara",
            "image": "as_contracts_and_leases",
            "order": 5
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "svc_buying_or_selling_a_business",
          "handle": "buying-or-selling-a-business",
          "title": "Buying or selling a business",
          "fields": {
            "summary": "For the owner on either side of the sale.",
            "description": "<p>We act for the buyer or the seller of a small business: the letter of intent, due diligence, the purchase agreement and the closing.</p>",
            "team": "team_chidi_abara",
            "image": "as_buying_or_selling_a_business",
            "order": 6
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "svc_tax_planning",
          "handle": "tax-planning",
          "title": "Tax planning",
          "fields": {
            "summary": "Tax planning for estates and businesses.",
            "description": "<p>Estate and gift tax, the tax side of a business sale, and the choice of entity for a new company, planned by a lawyer who is also a CPA.</p>",
            "team": "team_tomas_reyes",
            "image": "as_tax_planning",
            "order": 7
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "team": {
      "name": "People",
